creenshot02.png", "id": "751027667587165", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_751027674253831_3764186951519750621_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qLBMV-n9NC0Q7kNvwFP6rm-&_nc_oc=AdrxRUp9WxGH0WgH7WmLNuSH9Hw94vlk6ZblCBSB90ean1aufdbe5lRi27NN7_V3nIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMYe1HsL_ksnToiiBz5OzDm852FaYPvgiV1j8Za5-MdxQ&oe=6ADF6E2D"}, {"file_name": "_0004_TMVRP_Screenshot05.png", "id": "738701788921172", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_738701795587838_6480767104115671597_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GQ0akC4WDYMQ7kNvwEo5fFb&_nc_oc=Adpd8Rq2YMUGOQKwER-Rzh8wDGgIWIgFAkY6dDx4UqSZsMb6TwT6G_gqCNp7WuNOQYM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMv6nst33zu5cVO5o-2-WDvc3M3qREE9bsbIfdXjv4FSw&oe=6ADF5698"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TMVRP_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "2450055652091829", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_2450055655425162_8191799389640870627_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J7xbhKEVYE0Q7kNvwFPZKQj&_nc_oc=AdpL1t-l0ZWvyeYLmepoqktQU3X0zy8AdglKCkSzUg9wskiKfPSYEvYinA4gQY2woBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM6qTVoDQ_8xWq5m8vIbu6SbaX4covTvU_jMhRVYEVZwA&oe=6ADF655A"}, "display_name": "The Magician VR: The Cursed Wand", "keywords": ["Wizard", "Wand", "Magic", "Spells", "Sorcery"], "long_description": "\n**Become a magician in VR and cast spells with real wand gestures.**\n\n**The Magician VR: Prelude** is built around one core promise: **wand-gesture spellcasting**. Trace **wand gestures** in the air to form spell patterns, then unleash magic with precision. You\u2019re not pressing a button to \u201ccast\u201d \u2014 your **wand gestures** *are* the spellcasting.\n\n{1695912878036935}\n\n# Key Features\n- **Real wand gestures:** draw spell patterns and cast spells through physical motion\n- **Arcade-driven combat:** easy to pick up, satisfying to master with timing and accuracy\n- **Progression:** unlock new magic and upgrade your spell arsenal\n- **For casual and hardcore VR players:** fast to learn, deep to refine\n\n{831229583229935}\n\n# Visual Style & Original Soundtrack\nCrowville is an **early 20th-century** city twisted into a magical apocalypse: vintage streets, ironwork, old theatres, docks, churches, and crumbling districts under red skies and shadow. The stylised look uses **bold contrast** and **dramatic silhouettes** to keep combat readable while maintaining a epic fantasy tone.\n\nAn **original soundtrack** drives the experience\u2014from ominous atmosphere to powerful combat themes that amplify every spell impact.\n\n{1152961863583112}\n\n# Play Your Way\n1. **Campaign:** defend key locations and push back the invasion\n2. **Survival:** endless waves to test your builds, speed, and spell mastery\n\n*Work in progress: pre-alpha visuals, gameplay, and content may change or not appear in the final release.*\n\n\n\n\n{874591808686949}", "short_description": "Wand-based spellcasting in VR: trace gestures in the air, cast real spells, and strike back against invading monsters. Step into a dark, epic fantasy atmosphere as a mysterious invasion tears through a doomed city. Learn to control your wand with precision, unlock new spells and upgrades, and build a powerful magical arsenal. Face relentless waves of enemies, adapt your strategy, and grow from novice to formidable wizard."}]}, "developer_name": "Master Crowd Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mastercrowdgames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Master Crowd Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mastercrowdgames.com/the-magician-vr-2", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "conte